<!-- supplementum.stml - monetae quas indices ISO fixi (2026-09-17/)
     non collocant (pecunia-plan T1; pecunia-spec II.9).

     HISTORICA: in indice tertio (retractae) sine unitate minore - exponens
     ex ULTIMO indice uno archivato qui codicem tenuit (Wayback Machine,
     fons in attributo). EXTRA_ISO: emissiones locales sterlingae (pari
     valore cum GBP) - exponens = GBP in indice uno fixo (2), fons =
     gubernatio emittens. Lecta 2026-10-19.

     Generator recusat ordinem cuius codex iam in indice uno stat cum
     exponente diverso. Crypto (BTC ETH) extra ambitum (decretum ...JBC). -->
<supplementum>
  <moneta codex="ANG" exponens="2" status="historica" titulus="Netherlands Antillean Guilder"
          fons="https://web.archive.org/web/20221107144009/https://www.six-group.com/dam/download/financial-information/data-center/iso-currrency/lists/list-one.xml (Pblshd 2022-09-23)"/>
  <moneta codex="BGN" exponens="2" status="historica" titulus="Bulgarian Lev"
          fons="https://web.archive.org/web/20221107144009/https://www.six-group.com/dam/download/financial-information/data-center/iso-currrency/lists/list-one.xml (Pblshd 2022-09-23)"/>
